# Per-test plusargs for stop_wait_for_irq.
#
# This test exercises audit bug #4 — STOP #imm should load SR from the
# immediate and halt the pipeline until an IRQ ≥ new SR.IPL fires.
# Without IPL injection, the test would FAIL_NOIRQ (handler never
# runs).  Inject IPL=1 at cycle 400 — well after the STOP retires
# (which takes ~250 cycles in this small test) but before the
# 200k-cycle timeout.  STOP loads SR=0x2000 (IPL=0), so IPL=1 is
# above-mask and fires take_irq.
+ipl=400:1
